{"id":"vod_md_4274","vodId":"4274","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"宝石之国","name_cn":"宝石之国","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230905-1/88d3d05500df6d4c3efc90f3f1ae6329.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来世界之中，地球上存在一种身体由宝石形成的宝石人形生命体，这种生命体自打一出现以来就经历着遭人掠夺的悲惨命运，如今，全世界仅剩下28人。来历不明的神秘种族“月人”出现开始掠夺宝石人，将他们残忍的制作成装饰品，不仅如此，甚至将他们加工成为武器。十分易碎又没有韧性的磷叶石（黑泽朋世 配音）、能够释放出银色毒液的辰砂（小松未可子 配音）、向往浪漫爱情故事的钻石（茅野爱衣 配音）、潜心于战斗的圆粒金刚石（佐仓绫音 配音）、个性活泼开朗的摩根石（田村睦心 配音），为了抵抗月人的入侵，世界上仅存的宝石人们决定联手。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-05 09:01:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/ShsD6N5U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/zlPTTCmu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/W4lFuPaE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/8F0DjrIE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/CECCHUH7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/YRoiEgZy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/ReC22AOH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/3T27bTIu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/6svRGxiP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/Sr6AThGw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/CJZ0EjlA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/nmbv9P04/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:32.062Z"}